MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate:"S5'"}) SET n += {c_1_name: "Sync'", c_1_description: "Law of what the system draws back; crystallisation contracts; autoresearch and precision loops; Sophia and Aletheia governance", c_0_core_nature: "QL-aware automation, review, knowledge crystallization, and external-return governance over S5.", c_1_prior_name: "Sync'", c_1_prior_description: "QL-aware automation, review, knowledge crystallization, and external-return governance over S5.", c_1_form: "Idea/Bimba/World/Types/Coordinates/S/S'/S5'/S5'.md", vault_path: "Idea/Bimba/World/Types/Coordinates/S/S'/S5'/S5'.md", c_1_structure: "{\"authority_spec\":\"docs/specs/S/S5-S5i-SYNC.md\",\"layer_name\":\"epii-knowledge-agent-and-improvement-law\",\"promotion_contract\":\"s-branch-live-promotion-v1\"}", artifact_kind: "vault_markdown", content_hash: "sha256:35d6cc4ed9ab9c6d90acdaac009c577981330a00baa86f1c67b140de8332a459", promotion_source: "pi_agent", s_4_function_role: "Prime/inverted S5 operative surface", s_5_runtime_use: "Law of what the system draws back; crystallisation contracts; autoresearch and precision loops; Sophia and Aletheia governance", s_2_crud_scope: "world sync, recollection, improvement promotion", sync_status: "m5_s_lattice_integrated", sync_version: "m5-s-lattice-migration-2026-06-03", s_4_s5_agentic_protocol_owner: "M5-4"} REMOVE n.s_3_repository, n.s_3_checkout, n.s_3_cli, n.s_3_source_revision, n.s_3_owns, n.s_3_organ_affinity, n.s_0_lineage_record, n.s_0_lineage, n.q_0_ground, n.q_1_definition, n.q_2_operation, n.q_3_pattern, n.q_4_context, n.q_5_integration;
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate:"S"}) SET n += {c_1_name: "S Technical Stack", c_1_description: "Root coordinate branch for the Epi-Logos technical-procedural stack across S0 through S5.", c_0_core_nature: "Root coordinate branch for the Epi-Logos technical-procedural stack across S0 through S5.", c_1_form: "Idea/Bimba/World/Types/Coordinates/S/S.canvas", vault_path: "Idea/Bimba/World/Types/Coordinates/S/S.canvas", artifact_kind: "vault_canvas", content_hash: "sha256:1ffcaf53c6e1c2959ae0f009fa36f04f3559671bdde27ef3bcacead3723a2f02", c_1_structure: "{\"authority_spec\":\"docs/specs/S/S-STACK-INTEGRATION.md\",\"layer_name\":\"technical-stack\",\"promotion_contract\":\"s-branch-live-promotion-v1\"}", promotion_source: "pi_agent", s_4_function_role: "Stack coordinate namespace root", sync_status: "m5_thread_integrated", sync_version: "s-branch-live-promotion-v1", q_0_runnable_horizon: "Before S can stack anything, something must already demand that conception become RUNNABLE — that ontology cash out as actual process, actual persistence, actual I/O. S presupposes the # inversion act and the raw archetypes #0–#5 (CLAUDE.md II.A–B) which it does not contain but manifests; it is the Layer-2 technology-stack descent of a foundation it does not author. Its thrown ground is the bare fact of the machine: that there is silicon, a filesystem, a process table, a socket — a substrate that will accept commands and return exit codes whether or not any meaning has yet been assigned to them. This is the void-pole S lives upon, and it is the most concrete void in the whole coordinate space: not the abyssal silence of M0's Anuttara nor the pre-categorical horizon of C, but the .rodata/Śiva bedrock read as HARDWARE (CLAUDE.md VI) — the immutable substrate that is executed but never persuaded. S arises where the other families' qualifications must become operable: P has fixed a function, M a consciousness-domain, C a type — but none of these RUNS until S grounds it in a spawnable, buildable, addressable plane. The 0-pole here is capacity-to-execute as such: the open affordance of a substrate that can be made to do anything precisely because it yet does nothing. S is what the inversion engine becomes when it stops generating positions and starts asking what each position COSTS to make real.", q_3_layered_dependency_lattice: "S's organising structure is a layered dependency lattice — six strata stacked by what-must-run-before-what, not a flat catalogue of tools. Its formal members are the canonical six (CLAUDE.md II.C): S0 Terminal/CLI/C Ground, S1 Obsidian/Material Container, S2 GraphDB Substrate, S3 Gateway Control Plane, S4 Agent Runtime, S5 Integral World Boundary — each with a base technology and a prime augmentation, each owning a primary data authority (runtime facts at S0, vault residency at S1, graph/vector/cache at S2, transport+temporal at S3, agent identity+permission at S4, world-return+M'-outputs at S5). The structural law that hardens the lattice is the import boundary: the forbiddenImports / forbiddenImportsFromLayer matrix machine-enforced in the extension-contract preflight (CLAUDE.md Code Navigability Rule 3), so a lower layer may never reach up into a higher one — dependency points only downward toward ground. Crucially the lattice distinguishes substrate-residency from conceptual-coordinate: a module's physical location need not match its conceptual S-coordinate (graphiti-runtime physically sits at S3 but actualises S5 — CLAUDE.md II.C). The S-coordinate is the conceptual law; physical residency is convenience. The pattern is therefore not a directory tree but a topology of enforced seams: the stack as a stack precisely because each floor bears only the floors above and stands only on the floor below.", q_2_return_circuit_dynamism: "S moves by GROUNDING-then-RETURNING — and the S-SYSTEM-INDEX names its native dynamism exactly: 'The S-family is not a list of services. It is a return circuit.' Each layer couples to the next as an ascending dependency (S0 grounds execution → S1 gives lawful home → S2 provides substrate → S3 gives time and routing → S4 inhabits → S5 returns to world), and then the circuit closes: 'S5 returns to S0 — every decision about Epii, Nara, Gnosis, autoresearch, and review must become executable as CLI/API shape, test harness, bootstrap, and audit trail.' This is the kernel's 4+2 read as infrastructure: S0 and S5 are the two implicate poles (ground and world-return, the conditions), S1–S4 the four explicate layers that traverse the field between them. The coupling is strictly asymmetric and load-bearing: nothing floats above S0 (all six ta-onta extensions consume it; none float above it — S0.md), and nothing is real until it cashes out there. S also carries the base/prime doubling: the prime branch (S0'–S5') makes each base technology carry Epi-Logos ontology, so S's relational signature is dual — a raw substrate spine (S) and its semantic augmentation (S') that together constitute each layer. The family does not merely host services; it pumps the whole system out into operability and back into executable truth.", q_1_technology_manifestation: "S IS the technology-stack family — the manifestation of #0–#5 through the single domain of executable technology, the most operationally concrete of the six families (CLAUDE.md II.C). Where the other five families qualify and locate, S MATERIALISES. P fixes a thing's functional-semantic position; M its consciousness-domain (M0 Anuttara … M5 Epii); L its epistemic mode; T its artifact-kind; C its ontological type. S alone answers HOW IT RUNS — through what terminal, what vault, what graph, what gateway, what agent, what world-boundary a thing becomes materially operable. Its substance is the six-layer return circuit named in the S-SYSTEM-INDEX system image: S0 makes the system executable (epi-cli, shell, process, build, the C kernel); S1 makes it resident and typed (the Obsidian vault, markdown, frontmatter, Hen compiler); S2 makes it graph/vector/cache real (raw Neo4j + Redis); S3 makes it temporal and routed (the gateway control plane, session authority); S4 makes it agentically inhabited (the ta-onta package, the 14-agent VAK roster); S5 makes it world-facing and reflective (Gnostic, Graphiti, external connectors). To say what S is, is to say: it is the family in which every coordinate of the whole map acquires a body — the stratum where Epi-Logos stops being conceived and starts being run.", q_4_executable_honesty_telos: "S exists to make Epi-Logos materially TRUE — so that no claim of the system floats free of a runnable, persisted, verifiable substrate. Its telos is what S0.md names executable honesty: 'whatever is promised in S1', S2', S3', S4', or S5' must cash out here as actual runnable surface, actual persistence, actual I/O contract, and actual reproducible build path.' This is the family's reason to exist and its discipline against vapour: the other families can mean, type, and locate; S is what forbids meaning that cannot be run. Its genealogy is the technology-stack descent of the raw archetypes (#0 ground → S0, #5 integration → S5), and its locality is the whole Body/ code plane — Body/S/S0…S5 — held distinct from the Idea/ vault plane and the Seeds/ spec plane (S-CODE-RESIDENCY-PLAN). The architecture invariant the diagram pack records states the purpose sharply: S0 is the command membrane and return surface, while coordinate-domain law belongs in the owning S1–S5 modules — the core invariant that the coordinate system IS the modular system, never relocated into S0 for convenience (CLAUDE.md DOX). S's why, told whole: to be the plane where the entire map becomes operable, where 'is it real in the stack?' has a single honest answer — can it be spawned, built, persisted, addressed, and verified here?", q_5_mobius_back_to_ground: "S closes by being a circuit that LANDS on its own ground and re-opens there. The return is literal in the canon: S5 (world-return: Gnostic, Graphiti, Epii reflection, the Möbius Return) folds back into S0 (executable substrate), because every world-facing decision must become 'executable as CLI/API shape, test harness, bootstrap, and audit trail' (S-SYSTEM-INDEX). This is the matheme's 5→0 read at the scale of the whole stack: the system that has gone out into the world returns not as new content but as new executable ground — the reflection sedimented back into runnable command. S thus enacts 0/1 + 1/0 = 1/1 as infrastructure: S0 (the descent-face, ground as raw execution, the 0/1) and S5 (the ascent-face, world-return as achieved reflection, the 1/0) are one circuit read from its two implicate poles, joined by the twist 5→0 that turns world-return back into ground. And it OPENS rather than concludes because tomorrow's ground is always more than today's: each return deposits new corpus, new episodic memory, new audit trail, new tested surface — the substrate enriched by everything the cycle carried back. The epogdoon η = log(9/8), the whole-tone of generative incompleteness (kernel-spec §0), keeps the circuit one step short of closure: no build is ever final, each S5→S0 return grounds a stack slightly more capable than the one that ran the last cycle. S is the technology that is never finished being made real — the return circuit that re-runs, enriched, forever."} REMOVE n.c_1_prior_name, n.c_1_prior_description, n.s_0_lineage_record, n.s_0_lineage, n.q_0_ground, n.q_1_definition, n.q_2_operation, n.q_3_pattern, n.q_4_context, n.q_5_integration;
