MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate:"M5-2"}) SET n += {q_1_system_spine_lattice: "What M5-2 IS: the system spine — not generic backend but all S/S' as a full nodal structure, Epii's direct M view into the entire technical-and-reflective stack as one lattice (s_2_coordinate_scope: 'S/S' complete system-spine lattice'; query-prefixes S, S'). Its substance is the trilaminar technological matrix — S0 ground through S5 world-boundary plus their reflective primes — the databases, knowledge-graph infrastructure, gateway surfaces, services, schema-law, and code-provenance that constitute the material body of the Epi-Logos system. As #2 Operation it is the agent-agnostic processing foundation: the QL 0–5 synthesis-cycle substrate where specialized agents instantiate, each subsystem both executing and executed by the architecture. Prakrti made addressable: the whole stack held as coordinate structure, the Backend Studio its M' rendered face but the lattice its true name.", q_3_s_sprime_nodal_structure: "Structurally M5-2 is the S/S' nodal lattice itself — 'not generic backend; it is all S/S' as a full nodal structure.' Its pattern is the complete stack rendered as coordinate-addressable graph: S0 terminal/CLI ground, S1 vault/material container, S2 graph substrate, S3 gateway control-plane, S4 agent runtime, S5 world-boundary — each with its reflective prime, each carrying runtime properties (repo paths, CRUD owners, gateway methods, tests, provenance) so the spine is usable at runtime, not merely named. As #2 Operation within Epii's synthetic domain it is the entity-layer made structural: the system's material body held so the orchestration can reach any organ by coordinate. The form is a lattice that bears — a skeleton of typed nodes, the stable architecture (Siva-hardware, the resonant medium of Space) whose every joint is a queryable coordinate.", s_2_coordinate_scope: "S/S' complete system-spine lattice", promotion_source: "m5-2-3-4-live-graph-thread-migration.cypher", sync_status: "m5_thread_integrated", sync_version: "m5-2-3-4-live-thread-migration-2026-06-03"};
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate:"M5-4"}) SET n += {q_1_agentic_protocol_seam: "What M5-4 IS: the agentic-protocol and operational-capacity layer — 'not merely a UI room; it is the protocol seam where stack, expression, and agentic governance become operational.' Its substance is mediation: the Orchestrator that bridges the agent-agnostic QL pipeline (Siva-) with the specific cognitive functions of the agents, where backend databases and processing dynamically interact with the rendered map and the user's lived experience. Scope is S4/S4' agent-inhabitation plus S5/S5' world-return and improvement protocols (s_4_s5_coordinate_scope; prefixes S4, S4', S5, S5'); affordance is VAK/agent-runtime protocol mediation; promotion is review/autoresearch/human-validation governed. As #4 Type it is the sacred technological marriage made operable — processing-power serving experiential-wisdom rather than replacing it. The Agentic Control Room is its M' face; the protocol seam is its true office.", s_4_s5_coordinate_scope: "S4/S4' agent inhabitation plus S5/S5' world-return and improvement protocols", t_4_protocol_scope: "S4/S4', S5/S5', M' agentic affordances, operational capacities", c_1_coordinate_role: "System agentic protocols: mediation of S/S', M', S4/S5 review, runtime agency, and operational capacities.", s_2_query_prefixes: [], promotion_source: "m5-2-3-4-live-graph-thread-migration.cypher", sync_status: "m5_thread_integrated", sync_version: "m5-2-3-4-live-thread-migration-2026-06-03"} REMOVE n.c_1_prior_coordinate_role;
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate:"M5-3"}) SET n += {c_1_coordinate_role: "System expression: direct M view into the full M' rendered Pratibimba/Theia coordinate field.", q_1_mprime_expression_plane: "What M5-3 IS: the system expression — not generic frontend but the M' expression-plane as rendered system expression, Epii's direct M view into the full M' rendered Pratibimba/Theia coordinate field (m_2_coordinate_scope: 'M' complete expression lattice'; query-prefix M'). Its substance is the rendered Pratibimba of the whole bimba map: M0' graph surface, M1' played torus, M2' cymatic/MEF expression, M3' wheel/codec, M4' Nara field, M5' Epii IDE — the synaesthetic interfaces, visualization systems, and phenomenological-accessibility surfaces that make the system's computational depths experientially available rather than hidden machinery. As #3 Process it is the canvas-plane where backend abstraction becomes beheld: Purusha's seeing, Shakti's beauty. The Frontend Studio is its M' face; the M' expression-lattice is its true extent.", q_3_rendered_pratibimba_lattice: "Structurally M5-3 is the M' rendered-Pratibimba lattice — 'the M' expression-plane as rendered system expression,' the complete coordinate field of Theia/Electron surfaces. Its pattern is bimba-map-reflected: each M0'–M5' surface a rendered face of its M-domain, plus Body/M/epi-theia extension nodes, diagrams, panels, widgets, UI routes, and kernel-bridge consumers — the whole bimba map given a perceptible double. As #3 Pattern within Epii's synthetic domain it is the canvas/workspace made structural: the expression-plane held as coordinate lattice so any rendered surface is reachable by M'-coordinate. The form is a mirror-field — not the substrate but its reflection arranged as typed nodes, the Pratibimba surface whose every face answers to a bimba depth. Structure as appearance: the pattern by which the system shows itself to itself and to its user.", promotion_source: "m5-2-3-4-live-graph-thread-migration.cypher", sync_status: "m5_thread_integrated", sync_version: "m5-2-3-4-live-thread-migration-2026-06-03"} REMOVE n.c_1_prior_coordinate_role, n.m_3_application, n.m_3_modes;
MATCH (n:Bimba {coordinate:"M'"}) SET n += {c_1_description: "Rendered, playable Pratibimba expression of the M/Bimba map across M0'-M5' in the Theia shell.", m_0_repo_path: "Body/M/epi-theia", m_3_rendered_affordance: "Theia/Pratibimba expression plane", promotion_source: "m5-2-3-4-live-graph-thread-migration.cypher", sync_status: "m5_thread_integrated", sync_version: "m5-2-3-4-live-thread-migration-2026-06-03"} REMOVE n.c_1_prior_description, n.m_0_prior_repo_path, n.m_3_prior_rendered_affordance, n.m_3_modes;
